<name>Body Exterior</name>
<ttl id="1002X_S000H_744BI_T0049" variety="T0049">
<name>Roof Drip Side Finish Moulding Center LH</name>
<para id="RM0000004AQ001X" category="A" type-id="80001" name-id="8215X-00" from="200612">
<name>Removal</name>
<subpara id="RM0000004AQ001X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM0000004AQ001X_04_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___00008FX00000">
<ptxt>Remove Roof Drip Side Finish Moulding Center LH</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Apply protective tape to the body panel around the roof drip side finish moulding center LH.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B167629J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Disengage the 2 clips and remove the roof drip finish moulding center LH.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Do not remove the clips.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If a clip is damaged, replace it with a supply clip.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
